  "fashion": {
    "Overview": "An example of male vampire aesthetic fashion. Vampire fashion is defined by its dramatic, elegant, and anachronistic style, which draws heavily from historical periods, particularly the Victorian and Romantic eras. The look is intended to convey a sense of timelessness, aristocracy, and predatory grace. The color palette is stark and limited, primarily consisting of black, deep reds, and whites, with occasional accents of silver or dark purple."
